{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>SMaC\u00a0</strong>(<strong>S</strong>hotgun <strong>Ma</strong>id <strong>C</strong>af\u00e9)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The job is simple: all you have to do is serve the food ordered by the customers with a big smile on your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you might be wondering, <i>&quot;why am I holding a double-barrel shotgun?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glad you asked! It isn't just for branding. You see, we have some rules in our establishment, and customers who don't comply must be appropriately dealt with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work fast, make no mistakes and keep in mind that weirdos are <strong>not\u00a0</strong>welcome here. Do your part and I'm sure you'll have a wonderful time with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for applying, you start next Monday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998600/extras/c93087a579f836bc9a6e2c15a4ea381c.poster.avif?t=1772677046\" width=96 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998600/extras/c93087a579f836bc9a6e2c15a4ea381c.webm?t=1772677046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work five busy days a week at the caf\u00e9! Don't worry about weekends, we've got another team covering those.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the menu. Use the kitchen to prepare all 16 items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot the fakes. There are more than 15 types of anomalies, so keep an eye out for bizarre behavior.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life! Some of the unwanted customers are so cute that you might feel bad about shooting them. However, don't be fooled! They won't hesitate to hurt you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a promotion? Take on the Endless Shift and prove yourself by climbing the ranks of the Steam Leaderboards!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3998600?t=1772677046","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998600/3626f29ffe82199fbe863e71ea79949d8af9a718/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772677046","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998600/3885a3ffa075e86936fdeac504242cf5336bf804/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772677046","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998600/3885a3ffa075e86936fdeac504242cf5336bf804/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772677046","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>SMaC\u00a0</strong>(<strong>S</strong>hotgun <strong>Ma</strong>id <strong>C</strong>af\u00e9)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The job is simple: all you have to do is serve the food ordered by the customers with a big smile on your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you might be wondering, <i>&quot;why am I holding a double-barrel shotgun?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glad you asked! It isn't just for branding. You see, we have some rules in our establishment, and customers who don't comply must be appropriately dealt with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work fast, make no mistakes and keep in mind that weirdos are <strong>not\u00a0</strong>welcome here. Do your part and I'm sure you'll have a wonderful time with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for applying, you start next Monday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998600/extras/c93087a579f836bc9a6e2c15a4ea381c.poster.avif?t=1772677046\" width=96 height=96 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998600/extras/c93087a579f836bc9a6e2c15a4ea381c.webm?t=1772677046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work five busy days a week at the caf\u00e9! Don't worry about weekends, we've got another team covering those.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the menu. Use the kitchen to prepare all 16 items.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot the fakes. There are more than 15 types of anomalies, so keep an eye out for bizarre behavior.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life! Some of the unwanted customers are so cute that you might feel bad about shooting them. However, don't be fooled! They won't hesitate to hurt you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a promotion? Take on the Endless Shift and prove yourself by climbing the ranks of the Steam Leaderboards!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Nether Lamp"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3998600/80f9f3ea2dd61d03629796e1c44031f3c0c5f5f2/header.jpg?t=1772677046","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.stea